<title>GERMANY: LTU launches Norway flights June 19.</title>
<headline>LTU launches Norway flights June 19.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German holiday airline LTU International Airways said it will launch services to Norway from June 19, 1997.</p>
<p>The airline will fly weekly on Thursdays to Bergen and Lakselv from Duesseldorf until August 28, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Bergen was the gateway to the Norwegian fjords while Lakselv in northern Norway was the starting point for Polar tours, it added.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
